senses.gloss:
--born to माद्री (माद्रवती) through the favour of the अश्विन्स्: father of शतानीक and Niramitra, the latter by करेणुमती;
1: भा. IX. २२. २८-9, ३२; Br. III. ७१. १३५; M. ४६. १०; ५०. ५०; वा. ९६. १५४; ९९. २४५; Vi. IV. १४. ३८; २०. ४०.
felt joy at कृष्ण's visit to Indra- prastha; was sent to the northern countries, for gathering provisions for युधिष्ठिर's राजसूय;
2: भा. X. ७१. २७; ७२. १३; ७५. 4.
approved of Drau- पदी's desire to release अश्वथाम;
3: Ib. I. 7. ५०; १०. 9.
consoled by कृष्ण while in forest;
4: Ib. X. ५८. 4; ६४. 9.
heard from भिष्म the secret of the cycle of births and deaths.
5: Vi. III. 7. 8-१३.

--stars as sons of दाक्षायणी
